{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id761041773"}, "name":{"label":"say-no-to-spam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-12-07T12:46:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"3505013308"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, here’s a way to make it better."}, "content":{"label":"Devs: On Apple Watch if the current tasks are all done except for tasks that dont occur every day, it still shows the first page!\nImprove this awesome app by switching to the view of the 2nd page when all non daily tasks are complete. \nAlternatively provide a third page. Because its helpful to arrange morning tasks on first page, but not all first page tasks are every day tasks. \nE.g. I prefer to work out only 6 days per week. So on the day of rest, page switch doesn’t automatically happen.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id724250895"}, "name":{"label":"setanic hispanic"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-11-26T20:05:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"3464833777"}, "title":{"label":"Love it but"}, "content":{"label":"This app is wonderful I really enjoy the layout and it makes it fun to mark off the new habits that I put into practice. My only remark is I wish it allowed for a lot more pages to add more habits to add in every day. 2 page fulls seems reasonable but when you want to do more in a day I’d like it if there were maybe more pages of habits you can add , so you’re in control of how many you want and you’re not limited to only two pages. Aside from that this app is great and I give it 5 stars.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
