{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id927202677"}, "name":{"label":"AintItDeadYet?"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-11-26T09:27:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"3463334680"}, "title":{"label":"Works for a few days then resets"}, "content":{"label":"Hardy useful, it just erases all your data at the end of the week and you have to setup everything all over again. Totally useless and waste of time.  You also can only assign 6 tasks so it’s very limited and not worth the $$& at all.\n\nWish I didn’t waste money on this. Buyer beware.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id659860314"}, "name":{"label":"smargarete"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-11-23T06:58:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"3451142245"}, "title":{"label":"So close to perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I love so many things about this app, but it is not intuitive to learn how to manage daily tasks and takes a couple days to get totally familiar. Feels like I am pressing so many buttons to get to one thing. \n\nThere is simply not enough space for tasks.\n\nAnd finally, I would love to get this for my partners phone but as a shift worker the 12am reset would make the app pretty useless for him.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id292602418"}, "name":{"label":"Abitachiquita"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-11-10T21:24:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.7"}, "id":{"label":"3404717989"}, "title":{"label":"Only 12 habits???"}, "content":{"label":"This could be a great app. Why the limit of 12? So lame. Don’t limit my progress Streaks!!! Come on!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
