{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id281086001"}, "name":{"label":"ColourSipper"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-29T17:22:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3359272298"}, "title":{"label":"Great app!"}, "content":{"label":"Really enjoying this app so far and would recommend it. Only thing it needs is a more consistent Apple Watch app. Logging something in the watch app doesn't always sync to the phone (or, oddly, to the watch app itself). In any case, fantastic app otherwise and I use it daily.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id165893576"}, "name":{"label":"DarkCryo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-22T17:14:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3332529305"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect!"}, "content":{"label":"I like this app a lot and I use it everyday! But there are some little things to improve or that are just missing. \n\n- 12 habits is really not enough! With the enormous amount of icons available, you should be able to use a lot more of them. Beside, you’ll want a lot more than 12 tasks after just a little time in the app\n\n- Adding more habits would mean adding a way to sort and organize them. The 2 pages offer is not enough. A way to separate in categories maybe?\n\n- Lastly, a better reminder system would help to stay organise because right now the app reminds me some tasks that I already completed earlier.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id101366922"}, "name":{"label":"NiranS"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-22T08:13:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3331235829"}, "title":{"label":"Beautifully designed app"}, "content":{"label":"Lots of power with simple gestures. I can easily track what I want and get the stats without having to mess with a lot of complicated menus.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id43479313"}, "name":{"label":"CarlosGilberto1204"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-15T12:39:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3305756386"}, "title":{"label":"Simple and effective."}, "content":{"label":"I love how simple is this app, it’s very visual and easy to use. \n\nIf I could only ask for some additional features I would ask for:\n\n1 More options for the notifications/badge icon, like only seem that notification badge when I have an alert to do something instead of showing me how many task o have to do left. \n\n2 More spaces for streaks so that I can separate and name my diferente spaces/position page for diferente categories like heath, personal goals etc.\n \n\n:) \n\nOver all I love this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id320165669"}, "name":{"label":"Tutyouhou"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-15T07:30:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3304922835"}, "title":{"label":"Option extra time"}, "content":{"label":"Je pense qu’il manque une option ou peut calculer l’extra Time d’une action. Je m’explique : je me suis mis pour objectif 30min par jour de pratique de guitare, mais des fois j’en fais plus. J’aimerai savoir sur une semaine combien j’ai pratiqué exactement.\nPour ça il faudrait juste un minuteur qui comptabilise sur une durée déterminé la pratique en extra.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id150176775"}, "name":{"label":"Lugis2"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-10-14T06:33:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"3301033747"}, "title":{"label":"Has promise, but..."}, "content":{"label":"A good concept but confusing to use. Although it gives you options to do certain things every other day or only on certain days, I think it’s really designed around doing things every day.\nE.g. it will give me reminders or show activities as incomplete that are not supposed to happen today. \n\nAlso the results summary needs a redesign (graph axes are unlabelled, they use a line graph where it should be a bar graph, basic data visualization stuff like that). \n\nThere is a button that seems to flip my card over and show other activities in a different colour. What is this? What is it for? The tutorial doesn’t say. \n\nIs there a way to give feedback other than in a review? I haven’t found it.\n\nA promising app that needs some improvements.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id106000071"}, "name":{"label":"One of the best album I've hea"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-09-22T17:42:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0"}, "id":{"label":"3219243457"}, "title":{"label":"Regis"}, "content":{"label":"Very nice app thanx! Tasks with an end date (for example do something only for a month or for a week) would make this app even better!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id148508794"}, "name":{"label":"lukeesss"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-09-04T12:54:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"3153441359"}, "title":{"label":"Hard to use"}, "content":{"label":"I find it a very difficult app to use. They’ve taken every opportunity to avoid common design patterns for mobile and iOS apps. It might bring personality to the app, but I often find myself frustrated trying to perform simple tasks or confused as to how to view my progress and discern my current state.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id243706711"}, "name":{"label":"period tea"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-02-13T06:06:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.1.7"}, "id":{"label":"2203311279"}, "title":{"label":"prettt darn good"}, "content":{"label":"easily the best habit tracker app on the app store, worth the price and with NO dumb recurring fees. i love it :^)\n\nthe only improvement i can suggest would be to let users adjust the times their days start and end. my day certainly doesnt end at 12, closer to 2.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
