{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id334435132"}, "name":{"label":"kvdence"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-10T12:19:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1783978567"}, "title":{"label":"Great app. Could use some improvement."}, "content":{"label":"This app is definitely the best and most functional habit tracker I've used. \n\nI feel like there are a few things that could be added and improved upon. A big one for me is the fact that the app badge shows that there is a task that needs completing but when you open the app it doesn't say which task you need to do at that time. I've set specific times for me to do certain things and when I have more that one thing outstanding and only wish to do the one I need to at that particular time, it gets confusing. I wish there was a badge in the app on the specific task that needs to be completed at that time. At this point I can only guess which task I need to complete to get the app badge to go away. Other than that it's a great app. \n\nI also think it would be a great idea to carry over a few features from the \"Productive\" app. That app was my main before this but I feel Streaks has much more functionality and potential.\n\nKeep it up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
